			"notes": "- Variable day length support (fixes [#401](https://github.com/Qendolin/better-clouds/issues/401))\n- Ignore fog settings in cloud renderer (use BC's own fog settings)\n- Render clouds before translucent terrain when player is below cloud level (*mostly* fixes [#404](https://github.com/Qendolin/better-clouds/issues/404))\n  - There are still some edge cases where stained glass will render incorrectly\n  - OIT/Improved Transparency will come in the future hopefully to fix this\n- DH compat fix again (clouds disappearing when above clouds)\n- Enabling Iris shaders on Vulkan doesn't crash the game anymore (but still doesn't render clouds yet)"
		},
